tracts, or bills.\n\n\nPluto TV has the best in hit movies, cult classics, and blockbuster films. You\u2019ll find something for everyone on Pluto TV, with hits like \u201cTotal Recall,\u201d \u201cLast Holiday,\u201d and \u201cRango,\u201d cult classics like \u201cPulp Fiction\u201d and \u201cHot Rod,\u201d and more. Looking for rom-coms? We\u2019ve got \u201cLegally Blonde,\u201d \u201cOverboard,\u201d and \u201cTwo Night Stand.\u201d Fiending for frights? Horror movies such as \u201cCloverfield,\u201d \u201cHellraiser,\u201d and \u201cChild\u2019s Play\u201d are guaranteed to keep you up all night. \u00bfLe gustan pel\u00edculas? Ve \u201cForrest Gump\u201d y \u201cGuerra Mundial Z\u201d en espa\u00f1ol.", "short_description": "The leading free streaming TV and movie service is available to you! Watch 100s of live TV channels and 1000s of movies and TV shows, all streaming free. Pluto TV also offers over 45 channels in Spanish, including native language and dubbed movies, reality TV, telenovelas, crime, sports and more. Pluto TV is 100% free and legal: no credit cards, contracts, or bills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://corporate.pluto.tv/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pluto TV", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://pluto.tv/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["MOVIE", "MEDIA_PLAYER", "NEWS_AND_INFORMATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": []